function Confectory.AlgorithmProjection::Maintain (string view) -> string { description "At an explicit human batch boundary call the caller-selected maintenance callback, regenerate locally and conditionally acknowledge only the accepted request. Failed or rejected updates remain queued. Callback delivery is at-least-once across crash and requires stable request-ID deduplication.";provide Confectory.AlgorithmProjection::Maintain with Confectory.AlgorithmProjection::MaintainBody;}
